mutants  later joining the x-men after absorbing  ms marvel's  psyche along with her cree powers rogues  struggle with her superhuman abilities  as a huge part of her character though  workarounds have been developed  she never quite gets to let her guard  down entirely  some mutants are more obviously mutated  than others and  kurt wagner isn't able to hide his  differences quite as easily as some of  his colleagues  abandoned as an infant kurt was found  and raised by a sorceress  working in a bavarian circus he enjoyed  a happy childhood  as the circus members held no prejudices  towards mutants  and his acrobatic abilities were popular  with audiences  though he has always had his unique  appearance his powers of teleportation  didn't make themselves known until he  was a teenager  these powers manifested because kurt is  actually the son of the shape shifter  mystique  and the demonic warlord azazel his  parents less than  savory reputations have marked him his  whole life despite his own devout  catholicism  after a stint in the freak show in an  american circus kurt set out for germany  to find his foster brother stefan  who he learned had apparently murdered  several innocent children  the townspeople seeing kurt's demonic  appearance assumed he was the murderer  before they could enact vengeance  however professor x stepped in to save  him  despite the complications of his origins  and the prejudice that his devilish form  invokes  kurt is frequently depicted as upbeat  and friendly  proving that some people can push  through their own darkness  and emerged stronger for it who the hell  was this  gorgeous wagner but in the munich circus  i was known as the incredible night  caller  storm we're out of here everyone loves a  bad boy  and remy lebeau has been breaking hearts  ever since his comic book debut in 1990.  remy never had a chance at a normal life  however  having been kidnapped from the hospital  where he was born and subsequently  raised by the lebeau clan  thieves guild he was rumored to be the  prophesied child  that would finally bring the opposing  thieves and assassins guilds together  ten-year-old remy proved that his time  in the thieves guild  was fruitful when he attempted to pick  the pocket of the guild's patriarch  who then officially adopted him the  pint-sized criminal grew into a troubled  teen  working for the fiendish mr sinister for  a time remy went on to marry bella donna  boudreau  the granddaughter of the head assassin  of the assassin's guild  this union of the two factions was  short-lived however  as remy killed belladonna's brother  julian in a duel immediately following  the wedding  remy had to make a break for it but his  colorful past just won't leave him alone  despite this he remains a charming  member of the x-men as gambit  slinging his charged cards at enemies  with considerable panache  as any comic fan will tell you some of  the best heroes start out as  villains and no one exemplifies that  better than the icy emma frost  born into a wealthy boston family emma  was emotionally neglected by her  extensive family  moreover she was bullied at school but  when her psychic abilities manifested  she began a promising career as a  teacher tutoring her peers with the  support of her own mentor  a man named ian kendall her father  soundly rejected this pursuit however  and was further angered by video footage  of emma kissing ian after she discovered  telepathically that he found her  attractive the footage  taken by emma's sister was intended to  be used as evidence to get ian fired  but emma decided to respond by  blackmailing her father instead  surprisingly her father was impressed  with his daughter's strength of will  and offered her the family fortune emma  refused choosing to make her own way in  the world  away from the bonds of her stifling home  environment  emma then entered a period of  homelessness which saw her become the  white queen of the hellfire club  positioning herself directly opposite  professor x and his academy  years later however she would become  co-head mistress of xavier's  school alongside cyclops and sure emma  might be catty  aloof and often judgmental but her  difficult upbringing instilled in her  an iron-clad respect for hard work and  responsibility  she might not always be nice but she's  still one of the x-men's most dedicated  heroes  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one


